SimpleXML: XML documents as objects, with libxml2 of the package az.

The module simplexml of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/simplexml.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d,
its headers in include/php82/php/ext/simplexml.
